# (the user, 2026-10-28) the chord's progress: a ring of dots round it, growing clockwise from 12 o'clock as the chord
# goes on, full as it changes, then from 12 again; brighter in its last bar; as it is while held (REC); none at Drift
# Hold. Sunrain (Drift 16 bars, 130): its chords change on bars 17, 33 (this run's, deterministic); 32 dots, two a bar
wait 300
turn PRESET 5
wait 500
expect piece 5
# the chord's last sixteenth (bar 16 played): full, the last bar
bar 17
expect ringdots 32
expect ringlast 1
# the new chord, its first sixteenth: empty
wait 150
expect ringdots 0
expect ringlast 0
shot ring_0.png
# half way (eight bars played)
bar 25
expect ringdots 16
expect ringlast 0
shot ring_50.png
# its last bar, half through: brighter
bar 32
wait 900
expect ringdots 30
expect ringlast 1
shot ring_last.png
# held (REC): the ring stays as it is, four bars on
bar 37
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 1
expect ringdots 8
bar 42
expect ringdots 8
shot ring_hold.png
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 0
# Drift at Hold: no ring
spin K4 10
wait 300
expect par6 6
expect ringdots -1
expect layoutclash 0
